## Agent.retrieve()
N1 start 開始 (self, question)
N2 end 終了
N3 proc hits = []
N4 if for doc in self.index.search(question, top_k=5)
N5 if doc.score < 0.35 ?
N6 proc continue
N7 proc hits.append(doc.text)
N8 io return hits
