## Agent.call_llm()
N1 start 開始 (self)
N2 end 終了
N3 if for attempt in range(MAX_RETRY)
N4 if try
N5 io return self.llm.chat(self.history)
N6 proc except TimeoutError
N7 proc time.sleep(2 ** attempt)
N8 proc except ConnectionError
N9 io print('接続エラー:', e)
N10 io return None
N11 io return None
